  0022:  setTrigger 136
  0026:  speak 5 "Welcome. I've never seen you\nbefore. Where are you from?\n"
  009e:  speak Player "The city. Actually, I'm\nfrom another world.\n"
  00fc:  speak 5 "You understand my language?\n"
  013a:  speak Player "Yes, I do.\n"
  0156:  speak 5 "Sometimes it's hard and\nI don't sell much here.\n"
  01bc:  speak Player "I see.\n"
  01d0:  speak 5 "Many shoppers stopped coming.\n"
  0212:  speak Player "It must be the trouble\non the island.\n"
  0264:  speak 5 "Help me do something.\n"
  0296:  speak Player "What is it?\n"
  02b4:  speak 5 "Can you work in my shop?\n"
  02ec:  speak Player "Your shop?\n"
  0308:  speak 5 "Half day? The more you sell,\nthe more I'll pay you.\nYou know our language.\n"
  03a4:  speak Player "You might lose money.\n"
  03d6:  speak 5 "Don't worry. It'll be good\nfor me. How about eight hours?\n"
